    "q-136593": {
      "dom_id": "step-q136593",
      "name": "Question 7",
      "problem": "If $\\operatorname{cot}⁡x=-\\frac{1}{8},$ then $\\operatorname{cot}⁡(-x+3\\pi )=$",
      "worked_solution": "First, let's recall the graph of $y=\\operatorname{cot}⁡x.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14264109/assets/6eb672fe024f024f20c7c3c80947d1b47bade8f998e705d6f411ae3f298ecde2.png)\n\nFrom the graph, we note the following:\n\n- The period of $\\operatorname{cot}⁡x$ is $\\pi .$\n\n- Our graph has rotational symmetry of order $2$ about the origin. This means that $\\operatorname{cot}⁡x$ is an *odd* function, and we have\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cot}⁡(-x)=-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x.\n$$\n\nLet's now evaluate our expression:\n\n- Firstly, using the periodicity of $\\operatorname{cot}⁡x,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cot}⁡(-x+3\\pi ) & =\\operatorname{cot}⁡(-x+\\pi \\cdot 3) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cot}⁡(-x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Secondly, using the oddness of $\\operatorname{cot}⁡x,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cot}⁡(-x) & =-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x \\\\  & =-(-\\frac{1}{8}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\operatorname{cot}⁡(-x+3\\pi )=\\frac{1}{8}.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-136593-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "-8",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"104\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-136593-b",
